<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CACI raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CACI raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies &amp; Co Inc raised its rating on CACI International Inc to accumulate from hold.</p>
<p>-- Jefferies cited solid backog, which continues to grow and stood over $1 billion at the end of June.</p>
<p>-- Jefferies cited improvements within the company's fixed-price document-coding project with the U.S. Department of Justice are on track, with break-even performance expected in Q1 1998.</p>
</text>
